Z||000017||Haagster||07-20-2001||06:10 AM||||I spent hours playing Gunship on a C64.  By today's standard, it is a primative game, but in 1987 is was a good time.<P>BTW:  the Colt was Commodore's attempt to make an IBM compatible (around 1989 or so).  The Colt had an 8088 processor (XT) and 640K RAM.  Damn, now I feel old.................||||reg||6
